A plus-attached div in a list item ends at the next sibling marker

```
- +
:::
- b
:::
.
<ul>
  <li>
    <div>

    </div>
  </li>
  <li>b</li>
</ul>
<div>

</div>
```

```
1. +
::: note
x
2. b
:::
.
<ol>
  <li>
    <aside class="admonition note" aria-label="Note">
      <p>x</p>
    </aside>
  </li>
  <li>b</li>
</ol>
<div>

</div>
```
